package "Image Formats" #FFEBEE {
    class RasterImageHandler <<handler>> {
        extensions = [png, jpg, jpeg, gif, bmp, webp, ico]
    }
    note right of RasterImageHandler
        **MIME:** image/png, image/jpeg, image/gif, etc.
        **TreeNode:** ImageFileTreeNodeFactoryProvider
        **Selector:** *:file:*.gif, *:file:*.jpg, *:file:*.png
        --
        **Processing:**
        1. Read with javax.imageio.ImageIO
        2. Create BufferedImage
        3. Display in JScrollPane with JLabel
        4. Support zoom/pan controls
        --
        **Library:** Java AWT/ImageIO
    end note

    class SvgHandler <<handler>> {
        extensions = [svg]
    }
    note right of SvgHandler
        **MIME:** image/svg+xml
        **Handler:** BatikSvgViewerPanel (Kotlin)
        **Library:** Apache Batik 1.17
        --
        **Processing:**
        1. Parse with SAXSVGDocumentFactory
        2. Render with JSVGCanvas
        3. Support pan/zoom (mouse wheel, drag)
        4. Enable dynamic SVG updates
        --
        **Transcoding (SvgTranscoder):**
        - PNG: PNGTranscoder
        - JPEG: JPEGTranscoder (quality param)
        - TIFF: TIFFTranscoder
        - PDF: PDFTranscoder (via FOP)
        --
        **REST API:**
        POST /api/svg/convert
        POST /api/svg/manipulate
        POST /api/svg/merge
        POST /api/svg/optimize
    end note
}

