' vCard & Calendar (RFC Compliant)
' ========================================
package "vCard & Calendar (RFC)" #E8EAF6 {
    class VCardHandler <<handler>> {
        extensions = [vcf, vcard]
    }
    note right of VCardHandler
        **MIME:** text/vcard
        **RFC:** 6350 (vCard 4.0), 7095 (jCard JSON)
        **Library:** ez-vcard 0.12.1
        --
        **Handler Classes:**
        - VCardMapper (MapStruct)
        - VCardOrgManager
        - VCardDifferencer (Guava MapDifference)
        - VCardSyncManager
        --
        **Mapped Properties (RFC 6350):**
        Section 6.1: FN, N, NICKNAME, PHOTO, BDAY, ANNIVERSARY
        Section 6.2: ADR, GEO
        Section 6.3: TEL, EMAIL, IMPP, LANG
        Section 6.4: TZ, GEO
        Section 6.5: TITLE, ROLE, LOGO, ORG, MEMBER
        Section 6.6: CATEGORIES, NOTE, PRODID, REV, SOUND, UID, URL
        Section 6.7: KEY, FBURL, CALADRURI, CALURI
        Section 6.8: XML extension
        --
        **Sync Targets:**
        - Keycloak (user attributes)
        - Openfire XMPP (vCard XEP-0054)
        - Matrix (profile API)
        - Bedework CardDAV
    end note

    class ICalendarHandler <<handler>> {
        extensions = [ics, ical, ifb]
    }
    note right of ICalendarHandler
        **MIME:** text/calendar
        **RFC:** 5545 (iCalendar 2.0)
        **Library:** ical4j 3.2.14
        --
        **Handler:** ICalendarMapper
        --
        **Components (RFC 5545):**
        - VCALENDAR (container)
        - VEVENT (events)
        - VTODO (tasks)
        - VJOURNAL (journal entries)
        - VFREEBUSY (free/busy)
        - VTIMEZONE (timezone defs)
        - VALARM (alarms)
        --
        **Properties:**
        Descriptive: SUMMARY, DESCRIPTION, LOCATION,
                     CATEGORIES, CLASS, STATUS, PRIORITY
        DateTime: DTSTART, DTEND, DUE, COMPLETED,
                  DURATION, TRANSP, FREEBUSY
        Recurrence: RRULE, RDATE, EXDATE, RECURRENCE-ID
        Relationship: ORGANIZER, ATTENDEE, CONTACT, UID
        --
        **CalDAV Integration:** Bedework server
    end note
}

