package "Diagram Formats" #EFEBE9 {
    class PlantUmlHandler <<handler>> {
        extensions = [puml, plantuml, pu, wsd]
    }
    note right of PlantUmlHandler
        **MIME:** text/x-plantuml
        **Library:** PlantUML 1.2024.0
        --
        **Service:** PlantUmlService
        **Converter:** AntlrToPumlConverter
        **Registry:** AntlrToPumlConverterRegistry
        --
        **Source Code to PlantUML:**
        1. Parse source with ANTLR grammar
        2. Walk parse tree with PumlExtractionListener
        3. Extract classifiers (class/interface/enum)
        4. Extract relationships (inheritance, etc.)
        5. Build PumlClassDiagram model
        6. Generate PlantUML source
        --
        **Output Formats:**
        - PNG: Raster image
        - SVG: Vector (with Batik viewer)
        - EPS: Encapsulated PostScript
        - PDF: Portable Document
        - ASCII: Text-based diagram
        - ASCII_UNICODE: Enhanced text
        --
        **REST API:**
        POST /api/puml/generate
        POST /api/puml/render
        GET /api/puml/formats
        GET /api/puml/languages
    end note

